  "description": "TypeDB is a polymorphic database with a conceptual data model, a strong subtyping system, a symbolic reasoning engine, and a beautiful and elegant type-theoretic language: TypeQL.\n      To use this package, include a runtime library TypeDB.Driver.Pinvoke for your platform into your project as well: https://www.nuget.org/packages?q=TypeDB.Driver.Pinvoke.\n      It is also possible to reference a number of runtime packages for the driver in order to build a platform-independent application.",
